  "VERDICT": "t_hop spans 4.460x with a uniform 4 nH inductor across a 42.2:1 C_bank range -- NOT the sqrt(42.2)=6.50x the sqrt(L*C) law predicts, because the quantised transfer-gate width makes the small banks Ron-limited rather than LC-limited. Tuning L_k ~ 1/C_bank collapses the spread to 1.526x but does it by making the SMALL banks SLOW (bank 14: 29.8 -> 198.5 ps), which RAISES the beat-setting maximum from 132.8 to 198.5 ps. The wave is therefore left INCOHERENT on purpose: coherence is not needed, because every bank is cut at its OWN measured zero, and buying it costs 49% of the beat period."
